@startuml
title S-CORE Integration View with VEL

package "S-CORE" {
  [S-CORE Modules]
  [S-CORE Communication]
  [S-CORE Logging]
  [S-CORE Persistency]
}

package "VEL" {
  [Source Collectors]
  [NodeAgent]
  [Vehicle Evidence Output]
}

[NodeAgent] --> [S-CORE Logging] : collection/audit logs
[NodeAgent] ..> [S-CORE Communication] : applicable communication profile
[S-CORE Modules] --> [Source Collectors] : exposed module states
[Source Collectors] --> [NodeAgent] : collected records
[NodeAgent] ..> [S-CORE Persistency] : configured evidence persistence
[NodeAgent] --> [Vehicle Evidence Output] : normalized evidence

note bottom of [Vehicle Evidence Output]
VEL exposes evidence only.
No control or final OEM decisions.
end note
@enduml
